@startuml
actor User
participant "Angular SPA" as Angular
participant "TrainingController" as TrainingController
participant "TrainingService" as TrainingService
participant "ReviewLogRepository" as ReviewLogRepository
database "Database" as Database

User -> Angular: Rate card
Angular -> TrainingController: POST /training/review
TrainingController -> TrainingService: submitRating(cardId, rating)
TrainingService -> ReviewLogRepository: save(reviewLog)
ReviewLogRepository -> Database: INSERT review_log
Database --> ReviewLogRepository: Persisted row
ReviewLogRepository --> TrainingService: Saved ReviewLog
TrainingService --> TrainingController: Success
TrainingController --> Angular: 200 OK
Angular --> User: Show success

@enduml
